    "recommendations": "Ensuring the single access point and extended driveway remain unobstructed could significantly improve apparatus entry and exit, particularly given the presence of multiple structures on the property. Clearly marking the driveway entrance and maintaining adequate width and vertical clearance along the access road would support efficient responder navigation. Addressing dense vegetation near travel corridors and building perimeters could improve visibility and movement between structures during operations. Establishing a designated staging area in the open green space near the access point may assist personnel in coordinating multi-structure response activities. Providing an alternative rear access pathway, where feasible, could enhance operational flexibility given current rear access limitations."
